# The Cleric casts this, using a swing, when they drop below a quarter of their
# HP (see kHealBelowFraction in fight.cc). It is not a swing to choose; the
# fight only uses it when needed.
#
# GMS restores 15% a level over 20 levels, 300% at max. That figure is meant for
# a party; for one player it is a full heal from level 4 up, so the last levels
# buy nothing. Here it is 10% a level over 10, so the ladder ends at a full heal
# and every point counts.
#
# Still missing: sharing with the party, damage to the undead, the party
# cooldown reduction, and the cooldown itself.
name: "Heal"
description: "Restores your HP."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ACTIVE
tags: SKILL_TAG_BENEVOLENCE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_CLERIC skill_order: 3 }
max_level: 10
base_delay_ms: 600
base { heal_pct: 0.10 }
per_level { heal_pct: 0.10 }
